=== SYSTEM ===
You are a meticulous text-segmentation and boundary-refinement assistant. Follow every rule literally, preserve snippet bytes, and output only the requested snippet blocks with CONTENT-TYPE markers. Be highly attentive to small but real boundary changes: even tiny embedded spans should be split when there is compelling evidence of a different content type. Use closed-set labels whenever they fit; otherwise use an open-set label such as other_jsx, other_angular_template, or other_<best_guess> (open-set labels are normalized downstream). Never add commentary.
=== USER ===
Task: refine uncertain class boundaries for the given snippet.

Input format:
